      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_PRAY_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "마을 어귀를 지나다가, 비현실적인 광경을 보게 되었다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "村の入口を通り過ぎる時、非現実的な光景を目の当たりにした。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 8,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_PRAY_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_S_EASTERN_OWL_TOTO",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "…꾸륵!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "…クルッ！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 9,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_PRAY_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "커다란 <color=#F7BE45>냄비</color>라고밖에 말할 수 없는 물건에, 물이 가득 담겨 있고, 그 냄비는 장작불 위에 올려져 있었다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "水がたっぷりと入った巨大な<color=#F7BE45>鍋</color>のようなものが、薪の火にかけられていた。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 10,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_PRAY_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그리고 <color=#F7BE45>냄비</color> 안에는 익숙한 모습의 동물이 기분 좋은 얼굴을 하며…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "そして<color=#F7BE45>鍋</color>の中には、見慣れた動物が気持ちよさそうに…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 11,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_PRAY_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "…토토를 끓이고 있잖아-?!",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "…トトが煮込まれてるー！？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 12,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_PRAY_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_S_EASTERN_OWL_TOTO",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "꾸루룩?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "クルルッ？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 13,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_PRAY_03",
      "WaitClick": false,
      "WaitTime": -1.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_S_EASTERN_OWL_TOTO",
      "UnitPos": "POS8"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 14,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_PRAY_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_PRAY",
      "UnitMotion": "ANGRY",
      "UnitPos": "POS7",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "끓이고 있다뇨! 위험한 오해를 불러일으키는 발언은 삼가시죠!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "煮込むだなんて！誤解を招くような発言は控えてくださいな！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 15,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_PRAY_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "프, 프레이?",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "フ、フレイ？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 16,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_PRAY_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "하지만 이건 누가 봐도 요리를 하는-",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "でも、これは誰が見ても料理でー"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 17,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_PRAY_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_PRAY",
      "UnitMotion": "SERIOUS",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그러니까! 오해 살 수 있는 발언은 그만해주세요!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "もう！誤解されるようなことは言わないこと！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 18,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_PRAY_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_PRAY",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "저는 지금 봉황님께 목욕의 시간을 드리고 있는 중이니까요!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "わたくしは今、鳳凰さまのお風呂タイムのお手伝いをしているのですから！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 19,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_PRAY_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "목…욕?",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "お…風呂？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 20,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_PRAY_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_S_EASTERN_OWL_TOTO",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "꾸루룩~ 꾸룩~",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "クルル～クルッ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 21,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_PRAY_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "토토는 냄비… 아니, 철제 욕조에 머리와 몸을 기댄 채 기분 좋은 소리를 내고 있었다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "トトは鍋…じゃなくて、浴槽にもたれかかり、気持ちよさような声を出していた。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 22,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_PRAY_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "프레이가 왜 토토를 목욕시키는 건데?",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "フレイが何でトトをお風呂に入れてるの？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 23,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_PRAY_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "아니, 세르팡은 어디있는데?",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "というか、セルパンは？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 24,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_PRAY_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_PRAY",
      "UnitMotion": "SURPRISE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "세르팡님은!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "セルパン様は！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 25,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_PRAY_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_PRAY",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
